er 24, The Weeknd played a new song in Hong Kong. It is called Hong Kong. The song uses Faye Wong's 1993 Cantonese song Seasonal Wind.\n\nThe Weeknd likes Hong Kong films and music from the 1980s and 1990s. He also shared Faye Wong's music online before.\n\nFaye Wong is famous outside China too. She was the first Chinese singer to play at Budokan in Japan in 1999. She also sang a song for Final Fantasy VIII.\n\nFaye Wong is not a big star in the US and Europe.", "body_zh": "10月24日，The Weeknd在香港唱了一首新歌，歌名叫《Hong Kong》。这首歌用了王菲1993年的粤语歌《季候风》。\n\nThe Weeknd喜欢上世纪八九十年代的香港电影和音乐。他之前也在网上分享过王菲的音乐。\n\n王菲在中国以外也很有名。1999年，她成为第一位在日本武道馆开演唱会的华语歌手。她还为《最终幻想VIII》唱了主题曲。\n\n王菲在欧美不算大众明星。但那里很多乐迷到今天还喜欢她的老专辑。", "text": "On October 24, The Weeknd played a new song in Hong Kong. It is called Hong Kong. The song uses Faye Wong's 1993 Cantonese song Seasonal Wind. The Weeknd likes Hong Kong films and music from the 1980s and 1990s. He also shared Faye Wong's music online before. Faye Wong is famous outside China too. She was the first Chinese singer to play at Budokan in Japan in 1999. She also sang a song for Final Fantasy VIII. Faye Wong is not a big star in the US and Europe.", "vocab": [{"word": "sample", "pos": "verb", "zh": "采样", "note": "音乐里指取用别人歌曲的一段", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "song", "pos": "noun", "zh": "歌曲", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "show", "pos": "noun", "zh": "演出", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "famous", "pos": "adj", "zh": "有名的", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "film", "pos": "noun", "zh": "电影", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fan", "pos": "noun", "zh": "粉丝", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "album", "pos": "noun", "zh": "专辑", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "singer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "歌手", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-01T00:18:40.801393", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "On", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.375, "sm": 250, "em": 375, "cs": 0, "ce": 2